WEBVTT

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.350
They've now arrived at the planet Dewey.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.100
It is spectacular, isn't it?

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.810
They said all the representatives of the
Humanity Federation planets would be attending.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.350
This is an historic moment for humankind.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.400
After all, they'll be officially
announcing the discovery of the Nodos.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.490
King Meleagros of Yunos
of the Altria star system.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.960
For more than a century, we have
faced the threat of the Tribe of Silver,

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.000
that's been trying to destroy humankind.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:47.300
However, the time has come for us to put
an end to that long and painful history.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.640
I'd like to announce, here and now,

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.180
that we have successfully
discovered the Nodos  our savior!

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.310
In the prophecy of the Tribe of Gold,

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.570
it is said that the Nodos will
save humankind from extinction.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:10.320
Which can only mean that we are going
to win the war against the Tribe of Silver!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.660
I'd like to take this
opportunity to make a motion

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:18.370
to the Humanity Federation Council to
execute a counter-offensive operation!

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.300
A full-scale war, huh?

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.340
Yeah...

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:31.760
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:37.980
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:58.080
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:04.290
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.090
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:10.510
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:13.930
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:17.470
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.270
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:21.940
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:30.570
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:35.580
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:44.380
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:48.460
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:05.770
You just accomplished a great feat most
appropriate to the Yunos Family, Big Brother.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.780
The high-profile ambassadors
will be coming to the party tonight.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:13.110
And everyone's looking
forward to seeing the Nodos.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.530
Have you heard from Dhianeila?

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.580
No, nothing yet.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.800
I already told you the
importance of tonight's party, didn't I?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.550
A lot of VIPs from each
star system will be attending.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:34.640
They'll be so turned off if they
come and the savior isn't there!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.970
Try to put yourself in my shoes!

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.720
But I still can't force him, Big Brother.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:44.810
What are you talking about?
He's our Nodos, isn't he?

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.440
I need him there tonight, no matter what!

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.990
It is your responsibility to make
it happen. All right, Dhianeila?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.030
Good grief, my sister is such a pain.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:03.160
I want Age to relax at least
during our stay on Dewey.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.000
Once the all-out war
against the Tribe of Silver starts,

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:09.170
he won't be able to
take a break until it's over.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:15.010
We don't own Age. It's only
natural for us to respect his will.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:17.550
But I do understand where
my brother is coming from.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:21.520
We should probably introduce Age
to the people of the Federation.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:26.020
And I don't blame them for
wanting to meet Age, either.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.560
Should I ask Age one more time?

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.360
Ask Age what?

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.860
About tonight's party.
My brother is dying to have you there.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.740
M-e-l-e-a-g-r-o-s?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.030
Yes.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.030
Aren't you going, Dhianeila?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.040
No.
 Then Age will stay with Dhianeila.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:48.080
So, will you attend the party if I go?

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.550
No.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.550
Age is going to swim.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.840
We'll have to let my brother know.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:03.220
I'll tell him that it's taking time
to convince him, Dhianeila-sama.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.930
Thanks.

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:40.930
What did I try to do just now, and why?

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.310
Only lowly tribes have
such things as emotions...

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:50.270
Karkinos still hasn't come to.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:54.860
It's not your fault, Mehitak.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.900
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:17.630
Your Majesty, it is our honor
to be invited to today's party.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:19.800
We're excited to have you
here, Ambassador, Madam.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.800
I see many important people
from the Federation here tonight.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:25.970
It goes to show how respected you are.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.390
When will the savior be here?

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:30.980
It seems he's running a little
late, but he'll be here soon.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.520
I suppose it's a part of
the show to tease us all?

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:35.570
You could say that.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:40.320
Will Dhianeila-sama be here as well?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:44.160
No... She seems to be very
exhausted from the long journey.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.120
She's been recuperating at the vacation house.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:50.330
I'm sorry to hear that. I really
wanted to offer my congratulations

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:53.130
to the person who discovered the Nodos...

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:57.210
It can't be helped. She's just
returned from a major journey.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.970
Dhianeila is the pride of the Yunos family!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:03.340
I'm very proud to have such
an intelligent sister, as well.

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:08.890
If it weren't for Dhianeila-sama, we
might never have encountered the Nodos.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:20.030
It looks like the savior flaked on us, again.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.740
All they ever want to talk about is Dhianeila.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:26.200
I'm the one who made the
Argonaut, for crying out loud!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:29.870
Without me, there would've
been no Nodos discovery!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.920
That's right. So you just
be proud and stand tall!

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.890
You don't like parties?

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.890
There've been parties almost
every night since we've been back.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:52.060
Good point. Fighting may be
easier to do for soldiers, I guess.

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:55.400
But this is also a part of our duty as knights.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.400
Of course.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:01.190
I saw the battle records.
I'm quite impressed with the Nodos.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.690
He's on a different level.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:06.410
True. But it might be
possible for my Quental Unit

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.700
to have high-level
collaboration with the Nodos.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.120
I felt that way when I saw the records.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.410
Oh, hey, I apologize if I offended you.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:18.540
I didn't mean to say that your
Yunos Knight Unit is inferior to mine.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.090
No need to worry about
my feelings, Atalantes-sama.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:24.590
It's true we couldn't do
anything but watch him fight.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:28.300
I can't wait to fight alongside the Nodos.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:42.940
It is hard to believe that these people are
sitting on the doorstep of a full-scale war.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:46.280
This is the very epitome of today's Altria.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.110
The Yunos family used to
essentially be the leader

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.950
of the Humanity Federation
because of their rich natural resources.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.120
But now, they've fallen to the
level of this generous rich family,

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:58.330
that's just happy to be fawned on by others.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:03.300
Today's royals are just there to
waste the wealth of the star system.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:06.010
Are you saying that
Dhianeila-sama can change that?

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.970
The princess is the one fit to be the leader.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:12.140
Now that we have the Nodos,
the day for her to stand above

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:15.520
those thick-skulled brothers of hers
will surely come in the near future.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:19.310
And the Yunos family will regain
the brilliance that they once had.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:23.530
In order to do that, we must win
the war against the Tribe of Silver first.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:29.570
There's nothing to worry about. I believe
that the princess will lead us to victory.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:33.620
I believe that Age will
be the princess' strength.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:39.420
What a quiet night... It makes all
the battles we've had seem unreal.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.170
Just like Olone. It's quiet at
night and you can see lots of stars.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.260
Age, can I ask you something?

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.260
Yeah.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:53.850
Did the Tribe of Gold talk to you
about what awaits at the end of the war?

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:57.770
Dad and the others said
Dhianeila would lead us there.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:09:59.440
I would?

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:04.690
So, you're not the one who'll lead me there?

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.400
Dunno.

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.950
I see.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:18.410
The fifth one is now with the Tribe of Iron.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.670
There will be more forces rising up against us.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:25.960
Letting the Tribe of Iron live will
disturb the order of the universe.

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:27.670
What now?

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:34.550
We'll go after him and find him. We'll use
all the Nodos and obliterate him completely.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.390
All the Nodos...

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:37.970
Phaetho O.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.270
Yes, Rom Ror?

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.900
Go and see Prome O.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.610
Why?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:48.440
I feel fear.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:54.160
Go and see Prome O. That is her purpose.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.210
The Yunos family owns the Nodos.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:04.170
And so he must be under control of
the head of the family, which is me.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.500
But look at the reality.

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:11.260
I can't even make him attend a party.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:17.310
You're too easy on Dhianeila. If I were
you, I'd give the Nodos orders directly.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:23.730
But she's a fearsome person. She peeks
inside your head and reads your thoughts.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:27.020
You can't consider her
telepathic ability a power!

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:30.280
You command the Calydonian Unit, the most
powerful fleet in the Humanity Federation.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:33.450
Now that's true power!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.450
It's not enough yet.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:40.500
With the savior Nodos under me,
I'll become the king of all humankind!

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:46.000
I'm sorry to do this on your
day off, Captain Mobeedo.

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.380
I didn't know what to do
with all the free time, anyway.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:52.130
You see, a sailor on land has nothing to do.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:55.090
Then what about me, who's
stuck with desk work all day?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:58.810
Just the thought of it gives me a chill!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:02.520
Anyway, what did you want to talk
to this sharp-tongued sailor about?

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:06.980
Give me your take on how to handle the Nodos.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.570
Handle him?

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.320
We've been discussing organizing
the Federation fleet ever since

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:15.530
we received the motion from
His Majesty, but after reading your report,

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:20.830
it doesn't look like the Nodos can
work as a part of an organization.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.160
That means Age is capable of making
decisions for himself and fighting on his own.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:30.840
In every situation he's in, he understands
exactly what needs to be done 1 00%.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:37.050
In other words, he can function
no matter which ship he's on?

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:41.060
Council deliberations are
nothing but democratic formalities.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:43.680
It's just a matter of time before
they begin the counter-offensive

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.940
operation against the Tribe of Silver.
It's already been decided that

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:50.480
the Calydonian fleet is going to
be the center of the operation.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.360
I received the unofficial announcement
this morning that I'd be appointed

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.660
as the executive commander
of the Federation fleet.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:05.750
Well, congratulations to you, Big Brother.
So what did you do to make that happen?

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.750
Nothing.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.710
I just told them that the Altria star
system would pay half of the expenses

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:15.420
for the counter-offensive operation. That's all.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:24.850
So basically, Age is going to be on the
Calydonian Fleet's flagship, the Althaia?

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.770
There's a high possibility.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:30.940
It's a part of the setup to appoint
Meleagros-sama as the executive commander.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:34.900
If that's the deal, it's probably a
foregone conclusion that the Althaia

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:39.070
will become the Federation fleet's
flagship and Age will get stationed there.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.740
Everything will be determined at the
next emergency general meeting, Princess.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:46.120
Thank you, Captain. Let's see what they decide.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:54.840
Princess, is Age going to leave us?

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:02.800
Even if that happened, it still wouldn't
change the fact that Age fights for humankind.

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:06.270
But it was you who found Age, Princess!

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:09.440
Age should stay with the Argonaut!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.480
We only did our duty.

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:19.490
Do you really think so, Dhianeila-sama?

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:25.540
Age is already a member of our ship's
crew. He's our irreplaceable friend.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:14:59.610
Yuty?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:00.950
L-Let me go!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:04.570
I'm sorry. I thought you were him.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.280
It's okay.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.660
What happened to the fifth one?

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.040
Alive and well.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.830
How about Mehitak and Lecty?

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.880
They're standing by, of course.

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:19.920
I can go, too. I must... fight...

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.510
You have to fight, whether you like it or not.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.140
But it's pointless to send you out
there unless you're in good condition.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:32.520
I'm well enough now.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:37.650
This time I'm going to kill him for
sure, even if I have to die myself.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:39.360
Yeah...

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:47.660
I must overcome the fear and fight.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:56.880
Prome O, I'll give you this fear, which was
planted in me, in order to eliminate its cause.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:00.880
I'm the one who governs
the emotions of the tribe.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:05.390
That is to maintain the universal reason.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:08.760
Phaetho O, you shall
entrust me with everything.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.290
All your fear is now with me.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:51.470
Lecty, child of time... Did you hear it?

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.720
Yes.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.600
Tell me what you think.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:57.600
Emotions are something that you are born with.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.520
They're not something you plant, but
rather something that sprouts from within.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:09.780
I agree. But we of the Tribe of Silver
have deemed them unnecessary.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:15.290
And if we didn't have any emotions,
there'd be no need for Mehitak to suffer.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:20.630
Or for you to worry about him, either...

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:27.010
I wonder why the Tribe of Gold left us
agreements that give us such suffering...

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.930
I know this much...

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:35.980
That we can never get
away from the agreements.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:39.020
We must fight till the very end.

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:44.650
The Humanity Federation Council has
now reached a decision to execute

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:49.200
a counter-offensive
operation against the Tribe of Silver.

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:52.660
And we'd also like to
name King Meleagros of Yunos

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.700
as the executive commander
of the Federation fleet!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.090
I humbly accept this great mission.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:07.010
Humankind has been given
the Nodos by the Tribe of Gold,

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:12.350
and it is our duty to end
the Tribe of Silver's dictatorship.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.350
The war we're about to fight is a holy
war where we will reclaim the Earth,

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:19.390
which was once robbed from us, and restore
freedom to the entire universe once again!

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:26.030
As the executive commander
of the Federation fleet,

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:28.440
I'd like to make a request to the Council.

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:33.700
I seek your approval to officially station
the Nodos to our battleship Althaia.

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.870
Althaia is the flagship of the Federation fleet.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.700
Right. It shouldn't be a problem.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.710
Shouldn't we consider the fact that the Nodos

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.290
has been in several actual
battles alongside the Argonaut?

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:46.750
The most effective decision must be made here.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.800
Then we'll debate this issue at a later date.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:53.180
Please wait! The Nodos is our trump card!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:57.470
As such, it's only natural for us to
place him on the flagship Althaia!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:02.190
We must treat him very carefully,
precisely because he is our trump card.

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.450
Age stays with the Argonaut.

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:15.320
So the Argonaut will join the Calydonian fleet?

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.490
Sounds like that's what's going to happen.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.330
I'll be with the Althaia.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:23.620
I just received the transfer notice
from the fleet command center.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.420
Did they have some kind of divine revelation?

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.460
There's no doubt that it's convenient.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.180
I just heard from Captain!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.340
He said Age would stay with the Argonaut!

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:38.390
All right! All right!

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.620
We have to say goodbye
to this sky for a little while.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:56.950
So it's decided, huh?

00:19:57.030 --> 00:20:00.660
Yes. We're going to move out
in order to reclaim the Earth.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:07.750
Tonight, I think we're going to have a
beautiful starry sky, without a cloud in sight.

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:23.390
I used to love this place when I
was little. I came here very often.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:31.530
I used to think that the shooting stars
were having fun, chasing each other.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:37.070
And every time I saw a new twinkle I'd get so
excited, saying, "A new star was just born!"

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:45.540
I guess the same star had been there for a long
time, but I just didn't realize it until then.

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.130
It was really born.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.550
What?

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.260
You can see that, Dhianeila.

00:20:58.010 --> 00:20:59.970
I guess this is goodbye, huh?

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.070
Age...

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:19.370
From now on, many stars will be wiped
out and many paths will disappear.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:25.540
But you can find the paths
for many people, Dhianeila.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:29.250
And as long as you're there, many more
stars and many more paths will be born.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:36.130
Thank you for bringing Age here.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:40.390
But from here on, Age can go alone.

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:43.100
Goodbye, Dhianeila.

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:34.230
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:41.820
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:47.200
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:57.760
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:10.430
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:21.780
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.860 --> 00:23:26.780
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:33.500
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:40.840
A single, tiny light shines on
a scene of utter destruction...

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:45.510
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 1 1: "The Star of Brilliance."
